{"seq":2,"slug":"photo-mode-performance","title":"性能与超采样：暂停态是一笔可以挥霍的预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/practice/photo-mode-performance","wordCount":1788,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能与超采样-暂停态是一笔可以挥霍的预算\">性能与超采样：暂停态是一笔可以挥霍的预算</h1><p>游玩时，一帧只有约 16.7 毫秒（60fps）或 8.3 毫秒（120fps）可用，每一微秒都要斤斤计较——这是性能优化 hub 反复强调的帧预算，见 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/foundations/frame-budget\">帧预算</a>。拍照模式则把这套约束整个掀翻：世界暂停了，没有 AI、物理、网络在抢 CPU，玩家移动相机时如果一帧多花几十毫秒，体验上只是「稍微不那么跟手」，完全可接受。这一篇讲清楚拍照模式独有的性能观——它既是一笔可以挥霍的预算，又埋着几个暂停态特有的性能陷阱，还要在「捕获瞬间的超采样」这件事上算清一笔账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两种截然不同的性能语境\">核心概念：两种截然不同的性能语境</h2><p>拍照模式的性能必须分成两个语境来看，混为一谈是常见错误：<strong>取景态</strong>（玩家在移动相机、调参数，需要交互流畅）和<strong>捕获态</strong>（按下快门那一瞬，可以完全不管帧率、闷头渲染最高画质）。下图对比两态的预算与目标：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[进入拍照模式] --&gt; B[取景态]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[需交互流畅&lt;br/&gt;目标 30fps 以上]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[可提画质&lt;br/&gt;因无 AI/物理/网络]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[但要防暂停态陷阱]&#10;  A --&gt; C[捕获态&lt;br/&gt;按下快门]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[不管帧率&lt;br/&gt;可耗时数秒]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[开满超采样]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[配进度提示防误判卡死]&#10;  B1 --&gt; D[流畅创作]&#10;  C1 --&gt; E[极致成片]\">flowchart TD\n  A[进入拍照模式] --&gt; B[取景态]\n  B --&gt; B1[需交互流畅&lt;br/&gt;目标 30fps 以上]\n  B --&gt; B2[可提画质&lt;br/&gt;因无 AI/物理/网络]\n  B --&gt; B3[但要防暂停态陷阱]\n  A --&gt; C[捕获态&lt;br/&gt;按下快门]\n  C --&gt; C1[不管帧率&lt;br/&gt;可耗时数秒]\n  C --&gt; C2[开满超采样]\n  C --&gt; C3[配进度提示防误判卡死]\n  B1 --&gt; D[流畅创作]\n  C1 --&gt; E[极致成片]</pre><p>取景态要平衡流畅与画质：因为省下了游玩时的模拟开销，可以把这部分预算转投到画质（更高的临时渲染分辨率、更强的后处理）。捕获态则彻底放飞，只求成片质量，用 <a href=\"capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a> 讲的超采样、分块渲染榨干画质。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取景态-省下的预算投向哪里\">取景态：省下的预算投向哪里</h2><p>暂停后，游玩时占大头的 CPU 开销——游戏逻辑、AI 决策、物理步进、网络复制——几乎全部归零。这笔省下的预算不应白白浪费，而应转投画质，让玩家在取景时就看到接近成片的效果，所见即所得：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提高临时渲染分辨率</strong>：取景态可以偷偷把渲染分辨率或超采样倍率调高一档，让玩家预览就很清晰。</li>\n<li><strong>加强后处理</strong>：把游玩时为省性能砍掉的高质量景深、更多 Bloom 采样、更精细的屏幕空间反射打开，让 <a href=\"../tools/post-processing-filters\">后处理与滤镜</a> 和 <a href=\"../tools/composition-tools\">构图工具 (景深/视场)</a> 的效果所见即所得。</li>\n<li><strong>保留交互底线</strong>：即便如此，取景态仍需保持可接受的交互帧率（通常 30fps 以上），否则调相机会顿。这条底线约束了取景态的画质上限。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个务实原则：取景态画质设一档「预览质量」，介于游玩质量和成片质量之间——比游玩好看以体现拍照价值，又不到成片那么慢以保交互。</p>\n<h2 id=\"暂停态陷阱-时序效果的失真\">暂停态陷阱：时序效果的失真</h2><p>省预算是好事，但暂停态会打破几个渲染技术的隐含假设，产生游玩时不会遇到的视觉 bug。这些陷阱都源于 <a href=\"../camera/pause-decoupling\">暂停与解耦</a> 提到的「世界不动、相机在动」这一反常状态：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>隐含假设</th>\n<th>暂停态问题</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TAA 时间抗锯齿</td>\n<td>前后帧连续运动</td>\n<td>世界静止、相机动，运动矢量失真、鬼影</td>\n<td>切换为 SSAA 或空间 AA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动模糊</td>\n<td>物体有速度</td>\n<td>静止物体速度为零，或相机运动误算</td>\n<td>取景态关闭，捕获态按需重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间性 GI/反射累积</td>\n<td>多帧累积收敛</td>\n<td>暂停后不再累积，可能停在未收敛帧</td>\n<td>捕获前强制多跑几帧收敛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态分辨率缩放</td>\n<td>按帧率自动调</td>\n<td>无帧率压力，可能一直低分辨率</td>\n<td>拍照模式禁用或反向调高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>TAA 是最典型的坑：它靠累积多帧样本抗锯齿，依赖运动矢量重投影历史帧。暂停态世界不动，相机却在飞，运动矢量算出来是错的，画面会出现拖影和鬼影。稳妥做法是拍照模式下把 TAA 换成不依赖时间的抗锯齿（如 SSAA、SMAA），代价是抗锯齿质量或性能，但换来干净无鬼影的画面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"捕获态-超采样这笔账怎么算\">捕获态：超采样这笔账怎么算</h2><p>按下快门的瞬间，性能观彻底反转：不再有帧率要求，唯一目标是成片质量。此时可以把 <a href=\"capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a> 的所有重武器全开——高倍超采样、分块渲染、时间累积。超采样的成本是可以精确估算的。若目标分辨率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\times H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>、每维超采样 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，则实际渲染像素数是显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍，单帧渲染时间大致按像素数线性放大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>W</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{capture} \\approx T_{base}\\cdot k^2 \\cdot \\frac{W\\,H}{W_0\\,H_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_0 H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基准渲染的耗时与像素数。一张 4× 超采样的 8K 成片，渲染像素可能是屏幕的上百倍，单帧耗时飙到数秒完全正常。这在游玩里是灾难，在捕获态却只是「等一下」。唯一的用户体验要求是：任何超过约一两百毫秒的捕获都必须配进度条或加载提示，否则玩家会以为游戏卡死而强退，前功尽弃。这个「长耗时必配进度反馈」的原则，和 <a href=\"capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a> 里分块渲染的提示要求是同一件事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收敛-让累积效果拍完再交片\">收敛：让累积效果拍完再交片</h2><p>一个容易被忽略的捕获细节是<strong>时间累积效果的收敛</strong>。现代渲染里，光线追踪反射、GI、乃至某些景深实现，都靠多帧累积逐渐去噪收敛。暂停瞬间它们可能停在一个还带噪点的中间态。正确的捕获流程应当在写出图像前，让渲染器在固定相机姿态下空跑若干帧，等这些累积效果收敛干净，再抓取最终帧。这一步对光追游戏尤其重要，否则玩家的 8K 成片放大一看全是噪点，高分辨率反而放大了瑕疵。收敛所需帧数取决于效果和场景，通常几帧到几十帧，可根据噪声估计动态决定何时停止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拍照性能分两态：取景态要交互流畅（30fps 以上），捕获态可彻底不管帧率、闷头出最高画质。</li>\n<li>暂停省下的 CPU 预算（无 AI/物理/网络）应转投画质，设一档介于游玩与成片之间的「预览质量」，所见即所得。</li>\n<li>暂停态打破渲染的时间连续假设：TAA、运动模糊、时间累积、动态分辨率都会失真，需逐一切换或禁用。</li>\n<li>捕获态超采样成本按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与像素比线性放大，单帧数秒正常，但超过百毫秒必配进度提示防误判卡死。</li>\n<li>捕获前要让光追反射、GI 等时间累积效果空跑数帧收敛，否则高分辨率会放大噪点瑕疵。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"capture-resolution\">高分辨率捕获</a>（超采样与分块渲染的实现）、<a href=\"../camera/pause-decoupling\">暂停与解耦</a>（时序失真的根源）、<a href=\"../tools/post-processing-filters\">后处理与滤镜</a> 与 <a href=\"../tools/composition-tools\">构图工具 (景深/视场)</a>（取景态可加强的效果）、<a href=\"photo-mode-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>（捕获流程的其余边角）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：帧预算与性能方法论，见性能优化 hub 的 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/foundations/frame-budget\">帧预算</a> 与 <a href=\"../game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/gpu-bottlenecks\">GPU 瓶颈</a>；光照的时间累积与性能，见光照 hub 的 <a href=\"../game-lighting-global-illumination/practice/lighting-performance\">光照性能</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能与超采样：暂停态是一笔可以挥霍的预算","id":"性能与超采样-暂停态是一笔可以挥霍的预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两种截然不同的性能语境","id":"核心概念-两种截然不同的性能语境"},{"level":2,"text":"取景态：省下的预算投向哪里","id":"取景态-省下的预算投向哪里"},{"level":2,"text":"暂停态陷阱：时序效果的失真","id":"暂停态陷阱-时序效果的失真"},{"level":2,"text":"捕获态：超采样这笔账怎么算","id":"捕获态-超采样这笔账怎么算"},{"level":2,"text":"收敛：让累积效果拍完再交片","id":"收敛-让累积效果拍完再交片"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨链接"}],"prev":{"title":"高分辨率捕获：拍出比屏幕更清晰的照片","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/practice/capture-resolution"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：让拍照模式真正上得了线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-photo-mode/practice/photo-mode-in-practice"}}